-- APPLY ORDER: 2026-08-11-player-state.sql → THIS FILE → 2026-08-11-apply-engine.sql
--              → 2026-08-11-market-v2.sql
--   The two files after this one FAIL CLOSED if hr_items is absent: an unknown
